OL,3,AHundreds of criminals start leaving
OL,4,Aprison under new early release scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the plan has been strongly
OL,7,Fcriticised by victims and questions
OL,8,Fhave been raised over whether the
OL,9,FProbation Service has sufficient
OL,10,Fresources to monitor thousands more
OL,11,Fcriminals in the community.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
