OL,3,AWhat happened in failed execution of
OL,4,AChrista Pike - and what next?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPike, 50, was sentenced to death in
OL,7,F1996 for the murder of 19-year-old
OL,8,FColleen Slemmer, an attack that was
OL,9,Fperpetrated alongside her
OL,10,Fthen-boyfriend Tadaryl Shipp.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
