OL,3,ANetanyahu says flight attacker
OL,4,A'underwent Islamist radical
OL,5,Aindoctrination'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsraeli Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,8,FNetanyahu says investigations suggest
OL,9,Fthe man who stabbed his fellow pilot
OL,10,Fand tried to take over a flight from
OL,11,FDubai to Tel Aviv had undergone
OL,12,F"Islamist radical indoctrination".
OL,14,FThe Flydubai plane plunged more than
OL,15,F17,000ft (5,200m) two hours into its
OL,16,Fjourney on Wednesday, before passengers
OL,17,Fand crew overpowered the attacker and
OL,18,Fretook control to land safely.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
