OL,3,ANetanyahu says flight attacker
OL,4,A'underwent Islamist radical
OL,5,Aindoctrination'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to Fox News, Netanyahu also
OL,8,Fsaid it was looking "very likely" that
OL,9,Fthe attacker, who he said was an Omani
OL,10,Fnational, "was going to down the
OL,11,Fplane".
OL,13,FMeanwhile, the United Arab Emirates
OL,14,F(UAE) state news agency reports
OL,15,Finvestigations have begun there to
OL,16,Fdetermine "whether the incident was
OL,17,Flinked to any terrorist activity or
OL,18,Fpurpose".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
